    "created_at": "2026-10-06T14:34:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-06T14:34:33Z",
    "body": "Thanks for filing this, @whimboo. No strong reason for `/window/`, I followed the naming of the other window commands.\n\nI agree it belongs at `/session/{session id}/consume-user-activation`. Changing it now should be cheap, since the WPT side (web-platform-tests/wpt#40699) hasn't merged yet. WebKit's WebDriver does implement the current path, and we're happy to update it to match.\n\nWould you be able to send a PR for the spec change?\n",
