    "updated_at": "2026-10-06T15:01:26Z",
    "body": "While updating the WPT PR, I noticed the command's steps don't say what happens when the browsing context is closed. Other WebDriver commands check this, e.g. \"If session's current top-level browsing context is no longer open, return error with error code no such window.\" Could your PR add that too? I've dropped the WPT tests for those cases until the spec defines them.\n",
